            {
                "entry_id": "3a100037-38d0-37e5-b95c-1a1cc6b7ce18",
                "word": "plasticienne",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e6716d87-70b2-4881-92a5-e763dd8f415d",
                        "entry_id": "3a100037-38d0-37e5-b95c-1a1cc6b7ce18",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "plasticiennes"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "5bb1ef3b-0e8b-4323-8d88-741f07e5d5ec",
                        "entry_id": "3a100037-38d0-37e5-b95c-1a1cc6b7ce18",
                        "tags": [
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "form": "plasticien"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6da1864b-0f9a-3319-9002-d7130b52b629",
                        "entry_id": "3a100037-38d0-37e5-b95c-1a1cc6b7ce18",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Artiste réalisant des œuvres relevant des arts plastiques."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1754b12-780a-47b4-ba3b-269ebbcdae50",
                                "sense_id": "6da1864b-0f9a-3319-9002-d7130b52b629",
                                "text": "Dans le cadre de la saison France-Portugal 2022, Joana Vasconcelos, plasticienne réputée pour ses sculptures monumentales, a créé l’Arbre de vie pour la Sainte-Chapelle du château de Vincennes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29add383-fa0a-42fa-aebc-3e94516d9b01",
                                "sense_id": "6da1864b-0f9a-3319-9002-d7130b52b629",
                                "text": "Jusqu’au 30 mars, à Chamalières, dans le cadre de la semaine de la poésie, présentation du travail d’Odile Fix, poète, plasticienne et micro-éditeur."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec77eb74-85eb-4972-9d7e-e37038d6ea05",
                                "sense_id": "6da1864b-0f9a-3319-9002-d7130b52b629",
                                "text": "Depuis le dimanche 24 juillet, ses œuvres s’accompagnent de celles de la peintre et plasticienne Berc’hed Cadoudal, native de Brennilis, où elle réside toujours."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a44941d6-67dd-4645-a279-e0bb1396c238",
                        "source_entry_id": "3a100037-38d0-37e5-b95c-1a1cc6b7ce18",
                        "source_sense_id": "6da1864b-0f9a-3319-9002-d7130b52b629",
                        "target_lang_word": "plastician",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "plastician",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9fe49ae2-1f95-3a9b-b2a8-aa35a7d6c24c",
                                        "entry_id": "38fee51e-5f7d-3354-a8b4-1c8ed6b91ab7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that transforms or reshapes objects."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51378ae8-b3f7-4019-bf73-30acd62c533d",
                                                "sense_id": "9fe49ae2-1f95-3a9b-b2a8-aa35a7d6c24c",
                                                "text": "Quite apart from the question of finance and the basic difficulty of finding the very large sums for completely refacing buildings, the writer personally comes down solidly on the side of the \"plastician\" rather than the \"face-lifter\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad650153-f157-42a1-8ada-217db486c6a5",
                                                "sense_id": "9fe49ae2-1f95-3a9b-b2a8-aa35a7d6c24c",
                                                "text": "Today, I manipulate the sonic object as a sound plastician, and find myself confronted by the expression of a gesture which I cannot share except through the trace it leaves behind: the labelled object—that is, the sound recording."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd02d090-b011-45be-89fd-95ef98eb6026",
                                                "sense_id": "9fe49ae2-1f95-3a9b-b2a8-aa35a7d6c24c",
                                                "text": "Whatever in Nature is formed and shaped — be it the form of the plant persisting for a comparatively short time, or the eternally changing configuration of the animal body — carbon is everywhere the great plastician."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7205ff85-bba8-450b-aabc-1bf89ca7f1d0",
                                                "sense_id": "9fe49ae2-1f95-3a9b-b2a8-aa35a7d6c24c",
                                                "text": "This interpretation has provided the basis for a descriptive, 'plastician' approach that draws on pragmatism and aesthetics by combining experimental botany, developmental biology and biophysics of morphogenesis (Pouteau, 2011; unpublished data)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e75ca559-25fa-3228-98c8-e9015f3a2958",
                                        "entry_id": "38fee51e-5f7d-3354-a8b4-1c8ed6b91ab7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who works with molding metal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "268a6149-a213-4a24-8509-c64a13134ae1",
                                                "sense_id": "e75ca559-25fa-3228-98c8-e9015f3a2958",
                                                "text": "Tho first plastician was not a scientist, but with the gront demands of modern civilization the plastician today is attempting to systematize and simplify his job"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b25ddb5-f045-4be5-a093-c120e685dcb2",
                                                "sense_id": "e75ca559-25fa-3228-98c8-e9015f3a2958",
                                                "text": "The general problem of analyzing stresses and strains during even simple forming operations is still beyond the range of the theoretical plastician."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3139b88-baa2-46db-b2e3-0b726e6d75c1",
                                                "sense_id": "e75ca559-25fa-3228-98c8-e9015f3a2958",
                                                "text": "If this kind of real plasticity were to be incorporated in an analysis, the \"plastician\" would age rapidly and become a \"collapsian\" eventually."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2500100c-2664-4b02-87b8-c1f2c80ac1b1",
                                                "sense_id": "e75ca559-25fa-3228-98c8-e9015f3a2958",
                                                "text": "It may well be that in the future we shall be presented with a unified theory of mechanics which will bring together the apparently incompatible views of the plastician and the metallurgist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc96a25e-68d2-30d5-928e-927632a976bc",
                                        "entry_id": "38fee51e-5f7d-3354-a8b4-1c8ed6b91ab7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An artist involved with the plastic arts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7acce24-ccf0-42c6-a1b7-32ea4ee24138",
                                                "sense_id": "dc96a25e-68d2-30d5-928e-927632a976bc",
                                                "text": "I am an architect, a plastician, a constructor. In trying to explain the circumstances of the invention of a working tool meant for people engaged on construction, I have thought and written from the architect's standpoint."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79621cda-a573-4726-8741-13811e9396f3",
                                                "sense_id": "dc96a25e-68d2-30d5-928e-927632a976bc",
                                                "text": "They are also related to what has come to be recognized as 'found art', alongside the work of other modern artists or plasticians like the sculptor John Chamberlain, who worked out of junked car metal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a963354-46d2-3f4a-855a-4df2608e59de",
                                        "entry_id": "38fee51e-5f7d-3354-a8b4-1c8ed6b91ab7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An artist whose work is part of the plasticism movement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6ee509b-dcce-4ac8-9fde-3ee3457d6452",
                                                "sense_id": "6a963354-46d2-3f4a-855a-4df2608e59de",
                                                "text": "Even those who would practise a form of modern architecture (such as Le Corbusier. who is basically a cubist painter and plastician) conceive of architecture as painting, or as abstract composition in three dimensions, around which, but not in which, man walks in admiration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d29a9c0-c1e4-47da-b37b-7da63016922d",
                                                "sense_id": "6a963354-46d2-3f4a-855a-4df2608e59de",
                                                "text": "The history of contemporary art in Quebec presents itself fundamentally as an axis whose starting point is the automatist movement (1940-1950), followed by the plastician movement (1950-1965)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0f8e069-6f73-4be1-b92b-d52663d22c6c",
                                                "sense_id": "6a963354-46d2-3f4a-855a-4df2608e59de",
                                                "text": "Mondrian was above all a plastician, and he was primarily concerned with the plastic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0664357c-e559-46ff-bf05-0ce9fe0cf6ad",
                                                "sense_id": "6a963354-46d2-3f4a-855a-4df2608e59de",
                                                "text": "It is convenient to make these last two paintings the point of departure for modern painting, because they forget contours, volumes, chiaroscuro and even perspective. But these are only a plastician's objections."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "821f897e-82e1-4a0b-89e3-ce8a730a1843",
                                                "sense_id": "6a963354-46d2-3f4a-855a-4df2608e59de",
                                                "text": "There were two groups of plasticians as you probably know. The first group were adepts of de Repentigny, the art critic. The second was formed later by Tousignant and myslef. The first group, influenced by Leduc and others, conceived of plastician painting according to Vasarely, namely polychrome for new buildings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26fca4e2-5b22-4672-9db5-46377bc85a60",
                                                "sense_id": "6a963354-46d2-3f4a-855a-4df2608e59de",
                                                "text": "It is by great effort that I have now reached the point where I am, and it is because I am a plastician, and a very sensitive person by the way, and also because I believe in the necessity of the Aesthetics of Period, that I have the feeling of being emgaged at this time, and able to produce architectrual developments within which everything fits -- from the inside to the outside, ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e478b698-bd01-442d-bc8b-693aae7fc545",
                                                "sense_id": "6a963354-46d2-3f4a-855a-4df2608e59de",
                                                "text": "The neo-plastician will be forced by the domination of spirit to break every contact with the norms of feeling, such as humanity, love, art, religion etc."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e61bee34-60df-313a-86a3-2971229ca7a7",
                                        "entry_id": "38fee51e-5f7d-3354-a8b4-1c8ed6b91ab7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A plastic surgeon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "523f0fdc-6372-4d35-82d6-9d5fd4bb0a07",
                                                "sense_id": "e61bee34-60df-313a-86a3-2971229ca7a7",
                                                "text": "And this is particularly true in operative work on the face; and especially in the repair of breaches made by excision around the eye, mouth and nose; for here the experienced plastician, by studied plan, can often cover or disguise unsightly lines left by the scalpel; or if this be denied, then such lines may sometimes be so shifted as to be invisible. By such work the plastician will win parental gratitude by relieving the face of childhood of unsightly scars; and surgical art will gratify age when it utilizes the latter's furrows for plastic disguises."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5c6cdb1-dce2-41cc-b02d-85833ba28aa8",
                                                "sense_id": "e61bee34-60df-313a-86a3-2971229ca7a7",
                                                "text": "Gross and minute physical deformities could be corrected by the plastician while at the same time preserving function."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c365f5be-25b3-4388-bc89-88255fe8755a",
                                                "sense_id": "e61bee34-60df-313a-86a3-2971229ca7a7",
                                                "text": "We have offered our products to our own burn surgeons and to other specialists of our and other hospitals, namely dermatologists, plasticians and specialists for long-term illnesses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
